flowchart TB
  V[Vendor] --> P[Product family]
  P --> W[Web / hosted chat]
  P --> D[Desktop / IDE host]
  P --> C[CLI / headless agent]
  P --> H[Cloud task / review agent]
  P --> AC[ACP client / host]
  P --> AA[ACP agent / server]
  W --> MCP1[MCP client or hosted connector]
  D --> MCP2[MCP client + Skills + Plugins]
  C --> MCP3[MCP client/server + ACP agent]
  H --> MCP4[Restricted hosted tool surface]
  AC --> EXT[External agent owns model/tools/config]
  AA --> HOST[Editor owns UI and may forward MCP]
